WEBVTT

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:30.292
I was 11 years old.

00:03:31.417 --> 00:03:35.018
I remember being in a basement
with my father,

00:03:35.042 --> 00:03:37.893
in our home on the east side of Detroit.

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:41.059
I watched him stuff albums

00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:44.684
into the blue and orange milk crates,

00:03:44.708 --> 00:03:46.917
as tears streamed from his eyes.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.667
Just before that,

00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:53.500
him and my mother

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:57.518
had just sat me and my siblings down

00:03:57.542 --> 00:03:59.958
and told us that they
were calling it quits.